{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Race, dash, and dig as a worm.</strong> Unleash quirky worm-inspired items and compete in front of a roaring ant audience as you battle across chaotic maps filled with dynamic elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653330/extras/675f8afa21a422b14a7a33b1de47de15.poster.avif?t=1769522138\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653330/extras/675f8afa21a422b14a7a33b1de47de15.webm?t=1769522138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653330/extras/675f8afa21a422b14a7a33b1de47de15.mp4?t=1769522138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RaceWorms</strong> is a fast-paced competitive racing game where you tunnel through dynamic tracks, leaping in and out of the ground to gain bursts of movement speed. Use clever items to hinder your opponents and wriggle your way to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653330/extras/df31f5477f000e5daf698b0eaf9f8df1.poster.avif?t=1769522138\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653330/extras/df31f5477f000e5daf698b0eaf9f8df1.webm?t=1769522138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653330/extras/df31f5477f000e5daf698b0eaf9f8df1.mp4?t=1769522138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online multiplayer for up to 6 players, with local play for up to 4 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine online and local players in the same match</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple, intuitive controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full controller support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your worm with unique accessories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique items to slow down rivals, including a boomerang and bomb</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A distinctive picture book\u2013inspired art style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique sound track and sound effects</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653330/extras/07c04025c4cef1c8a390d9d27e92aca9.poster.avif?t=1769522138\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653330/extras/07c04025c4cef1c8a390d9d27e92aca9.webm?t=1769522138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653330/extras/07c04025c4cef1c8a390d9d27e92aca9.mp4?t=1769522138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please note: There are no single-player options in the game.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Diggin' It","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3653330/b807c2b36ec2a1e059fb39a575ba5ac8a6f6da10.jpg"},{"name":"A New Look","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3653330/220b60cb41caf9978212df4e22ed32daa698cfa0.jpg"},{"name":"Filling the Wardrobe","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3653330/6d7f101ca51e0307c235392da93ffa514020e4da.jpg